 "dialogue": [
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Last week, my four-year-old daughter, Sally, was invited to a children's party.",
   "zh": "上周，我4岁的女儿萨莉被邀请去参加一个儿童聚会。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 10.5,
    "end": 20.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "I decided to take her by train.",
   "zh": "我决定带她乘火车去。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 20.3,
    "end": 25
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Sally was very excited because she had never travelled on a train before.",
   "zh": "萨莉非常激动，因为她从未乘过火车。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 25,
    "end": 32.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "She sat near the window and asked questions about everything she saw.",
   "zh": "她靠车窗坐着，对她所看到的一切都要问个明白。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 32.5,
    "end": 41.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Suddenly, a middle-aged lady got on the train and sat opposite Sally.",
   "zh": "突然，一个中年妇女上了火车，坐在萨莉的对面。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 41.5,
    "end": 50
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'Hello, little girl,' she said.",
   "zh": "“你好，小姑娘，”她说。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 50,
    "end": 54.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Sally did not answer, but looked at her curiously.",
   "zh": "萨莉没回答，却好奇地看着她。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 54.5,
    "end": 60.7
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "The lady was dressed in a blue coat and a large, funny hat.",
   "zh": "那位妇女穿着一件蓝色的大衣，戴着一顶大而滑稽的帽子。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 60.7,
    "end": 68.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "After the train had left the station,",
   "zh": "火车开出车站后，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 68.8,
    "end": 72.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "the lady opened her handbag and took out her powder compact.",
   "zh": "那位妇女打开了手提包，拿出了粉盒。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 72.4,
    "end": 79.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "She then began to make up her face.",
   "zh": "然后她开始打扮起来。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 79.4,
    "end": 83.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'Why are you doing that?' Sally asked.",
   "zh": "“你为什么要那样做呢？”萨莉问。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 83.9,
    "end": 91.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'To make myself beautiful,' the lady answered.",
   "zh": "“为了把自己打扮漂亮啊，”那位妇女答道。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 91.1,
    "end": 98.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "She put away her compact and smiled kindly.",
   "zh": "她放好了粉盒，慈祥地微笑着。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 98.3,
    "end": 104.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'But you are still ugly,' Sally said.",
   "zh": "“可是你仍然难看呀，”萨莉说。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 104.5,
    "end": 109.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Sally was amused,",
   "zh": "萨莉感到很有趣，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 109.8,
    "end": 112.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "but I was very embarrassed!",
   "zh": "而我却很尴尬！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L141.mp4",
    "start": 112.3,
    "end": 118.1
   }
  }
 ],
